                <pb facs="1108" n="984" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg984"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    51.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">law.</hi></head>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article I</hi>. Roumania takes the title of
                        kingdom. Its sovereign, Charles I, takes for himself and for his successors
                        the title of King of Roumania.</item>
                    <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Art. II</hi>. The heir to the throne will bear
                        the title of Prince Royal.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
